{
  "title": "Feelings and opinions",
  "note": "With piacere the thing liked is the subject: Mi piace il caffè (one thing or an infinitive), Mi piacciono i dolci (several). The person goes before it: mi, ti, gli (to him), le (to her), ci, vi, or a + name. Adjectives of feeling agree: Anna è stanca.",
